# Loan Shark's Plot {3}{U} (CR 702.170a, a special action): Bot1 pays it with four Moxen on turn 1 (the pool empty after) and cannot cast it
# that turn (the refusal). On turn 3 it casts Mox Emerald, then the Shark from exile without paying its mana cost: a spell cast from exile
# counts as the second this turn, so the trigger draws. Hand: Emerald and Island left after turn 1, the turn 3 draw, Emerald cast: two; the Shark's draw: three.

